# PgBouncer User List for Staging Environment
# Format: "username" "password_hash"
# Generate hash with: echo -n "passwordUSERNAME" | md5sum
# Then prepend "md5" to the hash

# Example:
# "postgres" "md55e68e8c8ac6ee5d8b6e3263708ca5cea"
# "app_user" "md5XXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXX"

# SECURITY:
# 1. Copy this file to userlist.txt (without .example)
# 2. Replace with actual credentials
# 3. Ensure userlist.txt is NOT committed to git (.gitignore)
# 4. Set permissions: chmod 600 userlist.txt
